Subject: CPMS I03E1 Coverage Obligation Compiler
Description: Canonical formation for a deterministic, grammar-aware, non-executing compiler that projects exact schema sites, typed binding sites, ingress guards, residual policies, and resource limits into root-qualified I03E coverage obligations without creating cases, observations, agreement, or authority.

